{"4458120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Squap", "steam_appid": 4458120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Weakened and outnumbered</i>, you must rely on your <strong>weapon</strong> to survive. Your body cannot attack, but your <strong>weapon</strong> makes up for it. <strong>Bounce around</strong> the weapon, <strong>chaining attacks</strong> to survive wave upon wave of <strong>comically shaped enemies</strong>. Along the way, you must pick from the <strong>vast item pool</strong>, strategizing as to which item best <strong>fits your build</strong>. How long can you last in this <strong>wacky world</strong> of <strong>shapes and chaos</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarms of shapes seeking your demise, ultimately resulting in theirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of items and weapons each with unique effects and synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, rewarding gameplay. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of player choice and replay value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Weakened and outnumbered</i>, you must rely on your <strong>weapon</strong> to survive. Your body cannot attack, but your <strong>weapon</strong> makes up for it. <strong>Bounce around</strong> the weapon, <strong>chaining attacks</strong> to survive wave upon wave of <strong>comically shaped enemies</strong>. Along the way, you must pick from the <strong>vast item pool</strong>, strategizing as to which item best <strong>fits your build</strong>. How long can you last in this <strong>wacky world</strong> of <strong>shapes and chaos</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarms of shapes seeking your demise, ultimately resulting in theirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of items and weapons each with unique effects and synergies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, rewarding gameplay. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of player choice and replay value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Ready to bounce your way to victory? Well, then this is the game for you: Deploy your weapon and survive the relentless waves of shape-themed enemies. Pick from a wide array of upgrades and utilize them to build up your strength and cause chaos among your foes. HOW LONG CAN YOU LAST?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458120/7c46a9343d99ed6b8ba2e5883f8b2c757693a540/header.jpg?t=1773538727", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458120/d5d533ab85d10f160847fb22db5263f3d22ea1d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773538727", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458120/d5d533ab85d10f160847fb22db5263f3d22ea1d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773538727", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7 + <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 100 mb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Driftwood Games"], "publishers": ["